@startuml diagrama_sequencia
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter", "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 4
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #222222
    ActorBorderColor #222222
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #222222
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DatabaseBorderColor #222222
    DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LifeLineBorderColor #222222
    GroupBorderColor #444444
    GroupHeaderFontColor #111111
    DividerBorderColor #888888
    DividerBackgroundColor #F4F4F5
    DividerFontStyle bold
}

actor "Varejista" as Retailer
participant "PurchaseController" as PurchaseController
participant "CreatePurchaseAction" as CreatePurchaseAction
database "Banco de Dados" as Database
participant "CreateDeliveryOrderListener" as CreateDeliveryOrderListener
participant "CreateDeliveryOrderAction" as CreateDeliveryOrderAction

== 1. Solicitação de Compra ==

Retailer -> PurchaseController: POST /v1/offers/{offer}/purchase
activate PurchaseController #93C5FD

PurchaseController -> CreatePurchaseAction: execute(retailer, offer, dto)
activate CreatePurchaseAction #818CF8

CreatePurchaseAction -> Database: Bloqueia Oferta (lockForUpdate)
activate Database #FCD34D
Database --> CreatePurchaseAction: oferta
deactivate Database

alt Oferta inativa ou estoque insuficiente
    CreatePurchaseAction --> PurchaseController: lança 409 (insufficient_stock)
    PurchaseController --> Retailer: 409 Conflict
else Estoque disponível
    CreatePurchaseAction -> Database: Cria Compra e atualiza reserva da Oferta\n(define INACTIVE se esgotar estoque)
    activate Database #FCD34D
    Database --> CreatePurchaseAction: compra
    deactivate Database

    CreatePurchaseAction --> PurchaseController: retorna compra
    PurchaseController --> Retailer: 201 Created (PurchaseResource)
    deactivate PurchaseController

    == 2. Ordem de Entrega (Evento Assíncrono) ==

    CreatePurchaseAction ->> CreateDeliveryOrderListener: evento(PurchaseCreated)
    deactivate CreatePurchaseAction
    activate CreateDeliveryOrderListener #C084FC

    CreateDeliveryOrderListener -> CreateDeliveryOrderAction: execute(purchase)
    activate CreateDeliveryOrderAction #34D399

    CreateDeliveryOrderAction -> Database: Salva snapshots de endereço (coleta/entrega) e cria DeliveryOrder (status: PENDING)
    activate Database #FCD34D
    Database --> CreateDeliveryOrderAction: deliveryOrder
    deactivate Database

    CreateDeliveryOrderAction --> CreateDeliveryOrderListener: retorna deliveryOrder
    deactivate CreateDeliveryOrderAction
    deactivate CreateDeliveryOrderListener
end

@enduml
